    <div class="about-intro">
      <p class="about-lede">We make up stories on the spot in Bangalore. Every show starts with suggestions from the room, and nobody, including us on stage, knows what's about to happen next. Mostly, we're here to give people a room to be completely silly, shake off the workday, and remember how much fun it is to just play.</p>
      <p class="about-where">Improv Lore started in 2022. When Underline Center opened in Indiranagar, we moved in and never really left — our Wednesday jam is the longest-running weekly night the venue has. On any given week, you'll find us running jams for total beginners, squeezing extra plastic chairs into the room for sold-out weekend shows, or grabbing food together after the lights go down.</p>
      <p class="more-line">Out of town has lately meant out of the country. Since 2024, we've been invited to take our shows to improv festivals across Asia, playing in Singapore, Vietnam, Manila, and Hong Kong. <a href="/festivals/">See where we've travelled →</a></p>
    </div>

