    <div class="about-intro">
      <p class="about-where">Every now and then, we give improv a full day to itself. During our 12-hour marathon, we kick things off with TheatreSports, roll through back-to-back jams and beginner intros, and power straight through into late-night shows. It's the kind of day where people drop in for an hour to watch or play, and end up hanging out until midnight.</p>
